<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="DrugImplantThingMakeableBase">
		<defName>DI_FlakeImplant</defName>
		<label>drug-implant (Flake)</label>
		<description>A synthesizer, encoded to produce Psychite from nutrients the user eats. The user will need to eat more to sustain themselves as a consequence. The brain requires time to neurologically adapt to the constant presence of the drug, causing complications until the brain has adapted.

Once adapted, the synthesizer releases Psychite to stimulate the dopamine receptors in the brain, which causes a relaxing sensation. The user gains a significant mood boost and a minor amount of pain resistance.</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<RecipeDef>InstallDI_FlakeImplant</RecipeDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Item/Health/HealthItem</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
			<color>(189,169,118)</color>
		</graphicData>
		<statBases>
			<MarketValue>400</MarketValue>
		</statBases>
		<costList>
			<Flake>10</Flake>
			<DI_BaseImplantPart>1</DI_BaseImplantPart>
		</costList>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
				<li>DrugLab</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisites>
				<li>PsychiteRefining</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
		</recipeMaker>
		<thingCategories>
			<li>BodyParts</li>
		</thingCategories>
	</ThingDef>
	
	<HediffDef ParentName="ImplantHediffBase">
		<defName>DI_FlakeImplant</defName>
		<label>d-implant (Flake)</label>
		<description>A synthesizer, encoded to produce Psychite from nutrients the user eats. The user will need to eat more to sustain themselves as a consequence. The brain requires time to neurologically adapt to the constant presence of the drug, causing complications until the brain has adapted.

Once adapted, the synthesizer releases Psychite to stimulate the dopamine receptors in the brain, which causes a relaxing sensation. The user gains a significant mood boost and a minor amount of pain resistance.

Beware combining both Flake and Yayo implants; your pawn will have the high of their life...</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<ThingDef>DI_FlakeImplant</ThingDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
		<minSeverity>0.01</minSeverity>
		<maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
		<spawnThingOnRemoved>DI_FlakeImplant</spawnThingOnRemoved>
